lines:
唔，原来他们
用宝可梦吸引顾客。{be01}
嗯，也许我也该为我们的旅馆
找一只可爱的宝可梦做吉祥物。{be01}
这样就能吸引更多人
来我们这里住宿了吧？

Amazing! You’re telling me a Pokémon
found someone’s lost item?{be01}
That’s something. If we had some smart
Pokémon like that...{be01}
We could recover anything that our
guests mislaid...

Oh, sorry, sorry!
I was too involved in watching TV!{be01}
I heard that someone busted the
Team Aqua Hideout.{be01}
Thanks to that, we just booked a
reservation from a big group.{be01}
It was a company called... Uh...
Game something...

Amazing! A house-sitting Pokémon
caught a burglar?{be01}
That’s something. If we had a tough
Pokémon as a security guard...{be01}
We would be able to provide our guests
with greater safety.

啊，抱歉，抱歉！
我看电视看入迷了。{be01}
嗯，没错，刚刚来了
一个团队的客人，{be01}
他们以游戏狂想家之名订的房间，
我想他们一定是制作游戏的人。{be01}
啊——噢，我得赶紧
去准备晚饭了！
